window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch098","pages":[{"n":689,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图97.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0689-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图97.3\" width=\"968\" height=\"104\"><\/button><figcaption>图97.3 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此驱动模块就编译成功了，接下来进行测试。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b660\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">97.2.2 运行测试<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">将本章节编译好的ktype.ko 驱动文件拷贝到开发板上。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，使用insmod ktype.ko 命令进行驱动模块的加载，驱动加载成功之后，可以使用rmmod ktype 命令进行驱动卸载，如图97.4 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图97.4\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0689-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图97.4\" width=\"974\" height=\"113\"><\/button><figcaption>图97.4 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">通过图97.4 可以看出，当卸载驱动时，打印dynamic_kobj_release 信息，说明dynamic_kobj_release 函数被成功执行。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，引入并完善kobject_type 结构体实验就完成了。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b661\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第98 章创建属性文件并实现读写功能实验<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章学习如何创建带有自定义属性的kobject，以实现对其属性值的读取和写入操作。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b662\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">98.1 创建属性文件并实现读写功能方法一<\/h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b663\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.1.1 驱动程序编写<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验代码存储在网盘iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动例程\\70_attr\\module 路径下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验创建一个自定义的kobject，并在sysfs 中创建了两个属性——value1 和value2，允许读取和写入这些属性的值。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实验代码attr.c 代码如代码清单98.1 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单98.1<\/p>"},{"n":690,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"36\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/module.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/init.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/slab.h&gt; #include &lt;linux/configfs.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/kernel.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/kobject.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/sysfs.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的kobject 结构体，包含一个kobject 对象和两个整型值 struct mykobj<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       struct kobject kobj;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       int value1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       int value2;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义了mykobj 结构体指针变量mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct mykobj *mykobject01;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的kobject 释放函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static void dynamic_kobj_release(struct kobject *kobj) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       struct mykobj *mykobject01 = container_of(kobj, struct mykobj, kobj);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       printk(&quot;kobject: (%p): %s\\n&quot;, kobj, __func__);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       kfree(mykobject01);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的attribute 对象value1 和value2<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct attribute value1 = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .name = &quot;value1&quot;,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .mode = 0666,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct attribute value2 = { .name = &quot;value2&quot;,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .mode = 0666,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 将attribute 对象放入数组中<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct attribute *myattr[] = { &amp;value1,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        &amp;value2,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        NULL,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 690 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"690\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":691,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"72\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的show 函数，用于读取属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t myshow(struct kobject *kobj, struct attribute *attr, char *buf)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{        ssize_t count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct mykobj *mykobject01 = container_of(kobj, struct mykobj, kobj);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (strcmp(attr-&gt;name, &quot;value1&quot;) == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            count = sprintf(buf, &quot;%d\\n&quot;, mykobject01-&gt;value1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        } else if (strcmp(attr-&gt;name, &quot;value2&quot;) == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            count = sprintf(buf, &quot;%d\\n&quot;, mykobject01-&gt;value2);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        else<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        {   count = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的store 函数，用于写入属性值 ssize_t mystore(struct kobject *kobj, struct attribute *attr, const char *buf, size_t size)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct mykobj *mykobject01 = container_of(kobj, struct mykobj, kobj);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (strcmp(attr-&gt;name, &quot;value1&quot;) == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }   sscanf(buf, &quot;%d\\n&quot;, &amp;mykobject01-&gt;value1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        else if (strcmp(attr-&gt;name, &quot;value2&quot;) == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            sscanf(buf, &quot;%d\\n&quot;, &amp;mykobject01-&gt;value2);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}        return size;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的sysfs_ops 结构体，包含show 和store 函数指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct sysfs_ops myops = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .show = myshow,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};       .store = mystore,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的kobj_type 结构体，包含释放函数、默认属性和sysfs_ops<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static struct kobj_type mytype = { .release = dynamic_kobj_release,<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 691 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"691\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":692,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"101\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .default_attrs = myattr,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .sysfs_ops = &amp;myops,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 模块的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int mykobj_init(void)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 分配并初始化mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01 = kzalloc(sizeof(struct mykobj), GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01-&gt;value1 = 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01-&gt;value2 = 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化并添加mykobject01 到内核中，名为&quot;mykobject01&quot; ret = kobject_init_and_add(&amp;mykobject01-&gt;kobj, &amp;mytype, NULL, &quot;%s&quot;, &quot;mykobject01&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 模块的退出函数 static void mykobj_exit(void)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 释放mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        kobject_put(&amp;mykobject01-&gt;kobj);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_init(mykobj_init); // 指定模块的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(mykobj_exit); // 指定模块的退出函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">98<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_LICENSE(&quot;GPL&quot;);   // 模块使用的许可证<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">99<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_AUTHOR(&quot;topeet&quot;); // 模块的作者<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">100<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">101<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 692 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"692\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b664\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.1.2 编译驱动程序<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在attr.c 代码同一目录下创建Makefile 文件，如图98.1 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大原书第 692 页插图 1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0692-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"原书第 692 页插图 1\" width=\"974\" height=\"76\"><\/button><figcaption>原书第 692 页插图 1 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},{"n":693,"html":"<p class=\"caption\">图98.1<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Makefile 文件内容如代码清单98.2 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单98.2<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>Makefile<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">export ARCH=arm64#设置平台架构<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">export CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-#交叉编译器前缀<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">obj-m += attr.o   #此处要和你的驱动源文件同名<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">KDIR :=/home/topeet/Linux/linux_sdk/kernel    #这里是你的内核目录<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">PWD ?= $(shell pwd)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">all:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">\tmake -C $(KDIR) M=$(PWD) modules    #make 操作<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">clean:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">\tmake -C $(KDIR) M=$(PWD) clean    #make clean 操作<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 693 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"693\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在存放attr.c 和Makefile 文件目录下使用make 命令编译驱动程序，编译完成如图98.2 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.2\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0693-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.2\" width=\"977\" height=\"269\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.2 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">编译完生成attr.ko 目标文件，如图98.3 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0693-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.3\" width=\"977\" height=\"123\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.3 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b665\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.1.3 运行测试<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">将本章节编译好的attr.ko 驱动文件拷贝到开发板上。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，使用命令insmod attr.ko 进行驱动模块的加载，如图98.4 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.4\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0693-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.4\" width=\"971\" height=\"92\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.4 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后进入/sys/目录下，可以看到创建生成的myobject01，如图98.5 所示<\/p>"},{"n":694,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.5\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0694-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.5\" width=\"978\" height=\"133\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.5 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接着进入到myobject01 目录下，可以看到创建的属性文件value1 和value2，如下图98.6所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.6\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0694-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.6\" width=\"974\" height=\"128\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.6 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用echo 和cat 命令对属性值进行写入和读取，如果写入和读取均成功，说明实验成功。如下图98.7 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.7\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0694-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.7\" width=\"974\" height=\"204\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.7 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实验成功后使用rmmod attr 命令进行驱动的卸载，如下图98.8 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.8\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0694-fig04.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.8\" width=\"973\" height=\"109\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.8 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b666\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">98.2 优化属性文件读写函数<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">上节已实现带属性的自定义kobject 及属性值的读写。读写属性文件的作用是实现用户与内核空间的信息交换，用户可自定义属性及操作。本章将基于上节实验优化属性文件读写函数。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b667\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.2.1 驱动程序编写<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验代码存储在网盘iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资<\/p>"},{"n":695,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">料\\04_Linux 驱动例程\\71_attr02\\module 路径下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验创建了一个自定义的kobject，并在sysfs 中创建了两个属性文件，并实现了读取和写入这些属性的功能。属性对象value1 和value2 被定义为kobj_attribute 结构体，并使用__ATTR 宏进行初始化。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实验代码attr.c 如代码清单98.3 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单98.3<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"30\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/module.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/init.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/slab.h&gt; #include &lt;linux/configfs.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/kernel.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/kobject.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/sysfs.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的kobject 结构体，包含一个kobject 对象和两个整型值 struct mykobj<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      struct kobject kobj;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      int value1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      int value2;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义了mykobj 结构体指针变量mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct mykobj *mykobject01;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的show 函数，用于读取属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t show_myvalue1(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, char *buf) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      ssize_t count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      count = sprintf(buf, &quot;show_myvalue1\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的store 函数，用于写入属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t store_myvalue1(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, const char *buf, size_t count)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      printk(&quot;buf is %s\\n&quot;, buf);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的show 函数，用于读取属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t show_myvalue2(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, char *buf) {<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 695 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"695\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":696,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"66\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      ssize_t count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      count = sprintf(buf, &quot;show_myvalue2\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};     return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的store 函数，用于写入属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t store_myvalue2(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, const char *buf, size_t count)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      printk(&quot;buf is %s\\n&quot;, buf); return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义attribute 对象value1 和value2<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct kobj_attribute value1 = __ATTR(value1, 0664, show_myvalue1, store_myvalue1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct kobj_attribute value2 = __ATTR(value2, 0664, show_myvalue2, store_myvalue2);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的kobject 释放函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static void dynamic_kobj_release(struct kobject *kobj)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct mykobj *mykobject01 = container_of(kobj, struct mykobj, kobj);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printk(&quot;kobject: (%p): %s\\n&quot;, kobj, __func__); kfree(mykobject01);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 将attribute 对象放入数组中<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct attribute *myattr[] = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        &amp;value1.attr, &amp;value2.attr,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        NULL,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的show 函数，用于读取属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t myshow(struct kobject *kobj, struct attribute *attr, char *buf) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ssize_t count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct kobj_attribute *kobj_attr = container_of(attr, struct kobj_attribute, attr);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        count = kobj_attr-&gt;show(kobj, kobj_attr, buf);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的store 函数，用于写入属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t mystore(struct kobject *kobj, struct attribute *attr, const char *buf, size_t size)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{        struct kobj_attribute *kobj_attr = container_of(attr, struct kobj_attribute, attr);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 696 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"696\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":697,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"102\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return kobj_attr-&gt;store(kobj, kobj_attr, buf, size);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的sysfs_ops 结构体，包含show 和store 函数指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct sysfs_ops myops = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .show = myshow,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .store = mystore,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的kobj_type 结构体，包含释放函数、默认属性和sysfs_ops<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static struct kobj_type mytype = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .release = dynamic_kobj_release,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .default_attrs = myattr,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .sysfs_ops = &amp;myops,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 模块的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int mykobj_init(void)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 分配并初始化mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01 = kzalloc(sizeof(struct mykobj), GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01-&gt;value1 = 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01-&gt;value2 = 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化并添加mykobject01 到内核中，名为&quot;mykobject01&quot; ret = kobject_init_and_add(&amp;mykobject01-&gt;kobj, &amp;mytype, NULL, &quot;%s&quot;, &quot;mykobject01&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 模块的退出函数 static void mykobj_exit(void)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 释放mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        kobject_put(&amp;mykobject01-&gt;kobj);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">98<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">99<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_init(mykobj_init); // 指定模块的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">100<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(mykobj_exit); // 指定模块的退出/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">101<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_LICENSE(&quot;GPL&quot;);    // 模块使用的许可证<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">102<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_AUTHOR(&quot;topeet&quot;);  // 模块的作者<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 697 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"697\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":698,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">103 104<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b668\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.2.2 编译驱动程序<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在attr.c 代码同一目录下创建Makefile 文件，如图98.9 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.9\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0698-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.9\" width=\"981\" height=\"99\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.9 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Makefile 文件内容如代码清单98.4 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单98.4<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>Makefile<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">export ARCH=arm64#设置平台架构<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">export CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-#交叉编译器前缀<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">obj-m += attr.o   #此处要和你的驱动源文件同名<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">KDIR :=/home/topeet/Linux/linux_sdk/kernel    #这里是你的内核目录<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">PWD ?= $(shell pwd)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">all:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">\tmake -C $(KDIR) M=$(PWD) modules    #make 操作<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">clean:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">\tmake -C $(KDIR) M=$(PWD) clean    #make clean 操作<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 698 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"698\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在存放attr.c 和Makefile 文件目录下使用make 命令编译驱动程序，编译完成如图98.10 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.10\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0698-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.10\" width=\"961\" height=\"235\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.10 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">编译完生成attr.ko 目标文件，如图98.11 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.11\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0698-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.11\" width=\"968\" height=\"97\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.11 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},{"n":699,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b669\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.2.3 运行测试<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">将本章节编译好的attr.ko 驱动文件拷贝到开发板上。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，使用insmod attr.ko 命令进行驱动模块的加载，如下图98.12 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.12\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0699-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.12\" width=\"971\" height=\"92\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.12 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后进入/sys/目录下，可以看到创建生成的myobject01，如图98.13 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.13\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0699-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.13\" width=\"978\" height=\"133\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.13 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接着进到myobject01 目录下，可以看到创建的属性文件value1 和value2，如图98.14 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.14\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0699-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.14\" width=\"974\" height=\"128\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.14 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用echo 和cat 命令对属性值进行写入和读取，如果写入和读取成功说明使用宏定义创建属性成功。如图98.15 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.15\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0699-fig04.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.15\" width=\"974\" height=\"204\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.15 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实验成功后使用rmmod attr 命令进行驱动卸载，如下图98.16 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.16\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0699-fig05.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.16\" width=\"973\" height=\"109\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.16 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},{"n":700,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b670\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">98.3 创建属性文件并实现读写功能方法二<\/h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b671\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.3.1 驱动程序编写<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在98.1 小节的实验中，使用kobject_init_and_add()函数创建kobject,并创建了属性文件，实现了读写功能。本章节使用另一种方法—— kobject_create_and_add()函数创建kobject，并创建属性文件，实现读写功能。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验代码存储在网盘iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动例程\\72_attr03\\module 路径下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验使用kobject_create_and_add()函数创建了一个名为&quot;mykobject01&quot; 的自定义kobject，并在其中创建了两个属性文件&quot;value1&quot; 和&quot;value2&quot;。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实验代码attr.c 如代码清单98.5 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单98.5<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"22\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/module.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/init.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/slab.h&gt; #include &lt;linux/configfs.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/kernel.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/kobject.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/sysfs.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义了mykobj 结构体指针变量mykobject01 struct kobject *mykobject01;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的show 函数，用于读取属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t show_myvalue1(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, char *buf)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ssize_t count; count = sprintf(buf, &quot;show_myvalue1\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的store 函数，用于写入属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t store_myvalue1(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, const char *buf, size_t count) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printk(&quot;buf is %s\\n&quot;, buf);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的show 函数，用于读取属性值<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 700 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"700\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":701,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"58\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t show_myvalue2(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, char *buf)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ssize_t count; count = sprintf(buf, &quot;show_myvalue2\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 自定义的store 函数，用于写入属性值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">ssize_t store_myvalue2(struct kobject *kobj, struct kobj_attribute *attr, const char *buf, size_t count) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printk(&quot;buf is %s\\n&quot;, buf);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return count;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义attribute 对象value1 和value2 struct kobj_attribute value1 = __ATTR(value1, 0664, show_myvalue1, store_myvalue1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct kobj_attribute value2 = __ATTR(value2, 0664, show_myvalue2, store_myvalue2);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 模块的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int mykobj_init(void)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{        int ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // // 分配并初始化mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // mykobject01 = kzalloc(sizeof(struct mykobj), GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // mykobject01-&gt;value1 = 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // mykobject01-&gt;value2 = 1; // // 初始化并添加mykobject01 到内核中，名为&quot;mykobject01&quot;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // ret = kobject_init_and_add(&amp;mykobject01-&gt;kobj, &amp;mytype, NULL, &quot;%s&quot;, &quot;mykobject01&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mykobject01 = kobject_create_and_add(&quot;mykobject01&quot;, NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = sysfs_create_file(mykobject01, &amp;value1.attr);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = sysfs_create_file(mykobject01, &amp;value2.attr); return ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 模块的退出函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static void mykobj_exit(void)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{        // 释放mykobject01<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        kobject_put(mykobject01);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_init(mykobj_init); // 指定模块的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 701 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"701\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":702,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"62\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(mykobj_exit); // 指定模块的退出/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_LICENSE(&quot;GPL&quot;);    // 模块使用的许可证<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_AUTHOR(&quot;topeet&quot;);  // 模块的作者<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 702 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"702\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">驱动编写好之后，修改Linux 源码中的kernel/lib/kobject.c 文件，添加如下图98.17 框选的打印语句。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.17\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0702-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.17\" width=\"986\" height=\"576\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.17 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">添加完成后重新编译内核源码并将编译好的内核镜像烧写到开发板。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b672\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.3.2 编译驱动程序<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在和attr.c 的同一目录下创建Makefile 文件，如图98.18 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.18\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0702-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.18\" width=\"961\" height=\"100\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.18 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Makefile 文件内容如代码清单98.6 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单98.6<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"3\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>Makefile<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">export ARCH=arm64#设置平台架构<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">export CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-#交叉编译器前缀<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">obj-m += attr.o   #此处要和你的驱动源文件同名<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 702 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"702\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":703,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>Makefile · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">KDIR :=/home/topeet/Linux/linux_sdk/kernel    #这里是你的内核目录<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">PWD ?= $(shell pwd)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">all:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">\tmake -C $(KDIR) M=$(PWD) modules    #make 操作<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">clean:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">\tmake -C $(KDIR) M=$(PWD) clean    #make clean 操作<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 703 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"703\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用make 命令编译驱动程序，编译成功后如图98.19 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大原书第 703 页插图 1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0703-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"原书第 703 页插图 1\" width=\"975\" height=\"248\"><\/button><figcaption>原书第 703 页插图 1 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">编译完后会生成attr.ko 目标文件，如下图98.20 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.20\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0703-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.20\" width=\"969\" height=\"128\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.20 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b673\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">98.3.3 运行测试<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">将本章节编译好的attr.ko 驱动文件拷贝到开发板上。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，使用insmod attr.ko 命令进行驱动模块的加载，如图98.21 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.21\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0703-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.21\" width=\"971\" height=\"92\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.21 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后进入/sys/目录下，可以看到创建生成的myobject01，如下图98.22 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.22\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0703-fig04.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.22\" width=\"978\" height=\"133\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.22 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接着进到myobject01 目录下，可以看到创建的属性文件value1 和value2，如图98.23 所示。<\/p>"},{"n":704,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.23\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0704-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.23\" width=\"974\" height=\"128\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.23 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用echo 和cat 命令对属性进行写入和读取的操作，如下图98.24 所示，如果可以看到在写入和读取的过程中在内核中添加的打印，说明实验成功。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.24\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0704-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.24\" width=\"978\" height=\"480\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.24 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实验成功后使用命令rmmod attr 进行驱动的卸载，如下图98.25 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图98.25\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0704-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图98.25\" width=\"973\" height=\"109\"><\/button><figcaption>图98.25 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},{"n":705,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b674\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第99 章创建多个属性文件实验<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章节学习创建多个属性文件<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b675\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">99.1 sysfs_create_group 函数<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">sysfs_create_group()函数，用于在sysfs 中创建一个组(group)。组是一组相关的属性文件的集合。函数原型如代码清单99.1 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单99.1<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"1\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int sysfs_create_group(struct kobject *kobj, const struct attribute_group *grp);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 705 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"705\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数详细介绍如下：函数参数：kobj: 指向包含目标组的kobject 的指针。grp: 指向attribute_group 结构体的指针，该结构体定义了组中的属性文件。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单99.1 中，函数参数grp 是指向attribute_group 结构体的指针，attribute_group 结构体定义如代码清单99.2 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单99.2<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"6\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct attribute_group {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *name;  //组的名称，将用做sysfs 目录的名称<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct attribute **attrs;  //指向属性文件数组的指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //可选的回调函数，用于决定每个属性文件是否可见。如果为NULL，则所有属性文件都可见。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">mode_t (*is_visible)(struct kobject *kobj, struct attribute *attr, int index);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 705 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"705\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单99.2 中第3 行，属性文件数组是一个以struct attribute *类型为元素的数组，以NULL 结束。每个struct attribute 结构体表示一个属性文件，可以使用&amp;运算符将属性对象（如struct kobject_attribute）的.attr 字段传递给属性文件数组。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接下来使用sysfs_create_group 创建一个组并添加属性文件，如代码清单99.3<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单99.3<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"8\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct attribute *attrs[] = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        &amp;attr1.attr,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        &amp;attr2.attr,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        NULL,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">const struct attribute_group attr_group = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .name = &quot;my_group&quot;,<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 705 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"705\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"}]});
